  "details": "So far I've only noticed this for one avatar only but none other, but for one of my avatars, avatar scaling is just completely broken as in it's stuck at 1.62m when its prefab scale is set at 1.5m. Trying to adjust it does nothing, I can't even adjust it in worlds that scale through Udon. Just for context I have nothing like GoGo Loco on it or anything.\n\nAffected avatar: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_b5e23f72-91e5-49f2-885d-bf90db752e72\n\nTest world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e70c15c6-8598-49dd-b0dc-f57a1623c587\n\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/intkyi.mp4",
